290 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 499 0 R
/E (QDA was evaluated as a more flexible alternative to LDA because it allows the covariance structure to differ between fracture groups. At the 0.50 threshold, QDA had higher sensitivity at 34.4%, but lower specificity at 85.1% and PPV at 44%.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
291 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 500 0 R
